WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.057
Possible visual warning signs include inconsistent lighting or shadows, unnatural facial motion, unstable boundaries, repeated textures, implausible reflections, distorted hands or objects, and text that changes across frames.

00:00:13.057 --> 00:00:19.917
Audio clues may include odd cadence, abrupt tone changes, room-sound mismatch, or lip-sync problems.

00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:25.892
Background details deserve attention because generation and compositing may struggle with continuity.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:30.982
Signs, jewelry, clothing, furniture, and bystanders may transform across frames.

00:00:30.982 --> 00:00:37.400
However, motion blur, low bitrate, stabilization, and ordinary editing can produce similar effects.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.162
Compression artifacts are especially easy to misread.

00:00:41.162 --> 00:00:48.022
Social platforms resize and recompress media, destroying detail and creating blocks, ringing, or smearing.

00:00:48.022 --> 00:00:54.440
Multiple reposts make artifacts worse and can remove metadata that might otherwise help.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.759
Warning signs are leads, not proof.

00:00:57.759 --> 00:01:05.505
A single strange frame may result from network loss, interpolation, camera processing, or a paused expression.

00:01:05.505 --> 00:01:11.037
Genuine media can look artificial, and synthetic media can look natural.

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:17.897
Examine patterns across multiple frames or audio segments and compare them with source context.

00:01:17.897 --> 00:01:24.758
Preserve the original available file rather than relying on a screenshot of a repost.

00:01:24.758 --> 00:01:28.962
Document what was observed and plausible non-synthetic explanations.

00:01:28.962 --> 00:01:33.610
Do not declare authenticity because no artifact is visible.

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:37.372
High-quality synthetic content may be technically convincing.

00:01:37.372 --> 00:01:43.790
Conversely, do not accuse a person or publisher because an image looks odd.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:49.322
Strong conclusions require provenance, corroboration, and a transparent chain of evidence.
